[{"form_id":"0x000D6F|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"富と栄光だ、友よ。富と栄光。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D70|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"アズラの祝福を。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D71|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"こいつは嬉しい顔だな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D72|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"また稼げるようになって何よりだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D73|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何の用だ? もうお互いに話すことなんて何もないだろう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000800|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"幸運を祈ってるぜ!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D62|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"態度を改めないと、闇の一党に連絡するぞ。"},{"form_id":"0x000D63|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この野郎……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D63|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"分かった、分かったよ。お前さんの言う通りにするさ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000D64|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"闇の一党の一員だ。"},{"form_id":"0x000D65|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"冗談だろ? 怠けてないで、自分で稼いでこいよ!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D66|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"冗談じゃない。言動に気をつけないと、終わりだぞ。"},{"form_id":"0x000D67|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この野郎……乱暴はよせ。俺はお前さんの味方だぞ!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D68|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"シシスがお前の死を命じている！"},{"form_id":"0x000D69|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まったくだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D6A|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"お前と争う気はない、安心してくれ。"},{"form_id":"0x000D6B|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よし。さあ行け。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000D6D|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"今は私がギルドマスターだ。敬意を払え、さもなくば追い出す。"},{"form_id":"0x000D6E|respectful ravyn.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ……そう言うなら。それで決まりだ。悪かったよ、ボス。","index":1}]